Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one, so\Nlet's let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's really\Nwhere we should be going, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's escape with a stun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,While our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.22,0:01:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.28,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Let's go along\Nwith curiosity Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,our minds will never give up There's a\Nfire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gents, we have\Nthree of our finalists!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This trio of unbelievable\Ncontestants will now advance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.98,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to the final round and challenge\Nthe Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The champion of Block A, representing\Nthe Blackbeard Pirates, Jesus Burgess!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Our winner from Block B,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the irreverent leader of the pirate\Ncrew called the Baratie Club,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo the Cannibal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.60,0:03:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And now from Block C, everyone's\Nfavorite dark horse, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The long-anticipated\Nfinale is fast approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.38,0:03:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,as the arena needs immediate repairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the battle for Block D will be\Ndelayed by about 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, folks! Oh, come on! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After all that build-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We appreciate your patience as\Nwe prepare for the BLOCK D-MATCH!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,CABBAGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the random!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gavadish doesn't know\Nwhen to quit, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I WANT HIM!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is his deal I don't know\Nsaid something about Straw Hat Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you mean Straw Hat isn't\NStraw Hat Luffy the one who
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't even save his brother's\Nlife during the war the best,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody can get famous for\Nnot being able to do something
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go me scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that I happen to be\Na nobleman from the kingdom of big shots
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's funny since you had enough\Nbreath to talk smack a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Straw Hat Luffy\Nis a hero in his own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be the legend that defines this era!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The future king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been over two years since that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,At lockdown in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,On the same scaffold with Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of the Pirates was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard him shout to the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And in that fateful moment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A bolt of thunder split the\Nheavens and saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I witnessed a true miracle that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since then, I've been following\Nthe Straw Hat's adventures in the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alabasta, Innie's Lobby, Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:06:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And who could forget that\Nlegendary showdown at Marine Ford?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, what should we do\Nwith the soldiers we captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Drown them, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Back home, I was just a gang leader\Nwho took over 150 towns. No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But Luffy inspired me to be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I set out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let me see, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, you were making fun of Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just what makes you think\Nyou're anything to write home about,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,huh, you jackass?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to cut out your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Worthless piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is everyone fighting now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off my\Nsword, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.72,0:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you just leave me alone and let\Nus settle this crap some other time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been fighting people all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody pull him apart! Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't blame you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too nervous to walk up to him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.80,0:07:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if I did, what would I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He really does have a\Nscar under his left eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even more amazing a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see through\Nall these tears of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does that cabbage asshole think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rip him limb from\Nlimb and save Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in for it now, Cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw up, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our grandfather has something\Nimportant to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Grandpa. It's okay. Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, would you just leave me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've abandoned my grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must express my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.86,0:08:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What I wanted to say was thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, grandson of Garf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.98,0:08:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy just ran past me! Hold on! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you run away from our duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The great straw had Luffy in the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want to talk to him,\Nbut I think I'm too shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To show my gratitude\Nfor restoring my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to place you in charge\Nof my grandson's hop-a-swee army.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:08:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm too tired for all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're, uh... I'm Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in demand, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure, thanks for the help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, that goes for Shiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think we should\Ntake Aokiji's word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain, I'm sorry! One second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Really now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Put him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised to hear you were\Nmy commander's baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna miss the big show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to be there\Nfor your brother's execution?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, hasn't it, old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you're competing in\Nthe Gladiator tournament, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But forget about the flame flame fruit,\NBurgess is going to win that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.34,0:10:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted Ace to join the Blackbeard Pirates\Nback in the day, but he turned me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So this way, I can have the next\Nbest thing. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're never getting Ace's\Npower as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't wait to\Nmake you eat those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling you know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let him win that prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Got any more you can't eat all my\Nfree samples without buying any.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about that, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me which one you'd like to have Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Jimmy you're gonna pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.68,0:11:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Rebecca friend of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I couldn't afford to buy you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for treating me to lunch, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the living quarters for\Nthe gladiators who fight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I suppose it's more like a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The guest competitors\Nwon't be coming down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can rest up for your next match.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.26,0:12:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's cool. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a great fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really impressed when\NI saw that last battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The food here is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, you're not hungry too, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.70,0:13:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't get hungry. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you like a samurai or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it, Rebecca! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you brought him here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.82,0:13:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not make me drop my food!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.28,0:13:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, you'll never\Naccomplish your mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually caught Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he move faster than her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, do your worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll accept my fate, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, you think\NI'm gonna hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But you gave me food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I just tried to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.84,0:14:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you tried to attack me, but kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can afford to\Nforgive her that easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that means she was never a\Nthreat to him in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This would have been a\Ngood chance to knock out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,one of the competitors who\Nhas Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, mummies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're prisoners, forced\Nto fight as gladiators.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So is Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They throw us out into\Nthe arena for the crowd's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,entertainment to the day\Nwe finally wind up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All because we got on the Don\NQuixote family's bad side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The King promised he would let us go free\Nif we managed to win a thousand battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter how strong you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,no one can win that many\Nfights to the death in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And everybody who's tried to run away up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,until now has been shot\Nand killed on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hope left for us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,before Doflamingo became king around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we had gladiator matches,\Nbut never to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:16:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the light there is in this kingdom\Nof his, there's just as much darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, no matter what it takes,\NI will win this competition today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the power of the Flame\NFlame Fruit, I kill Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the toy soldier told me he's planning on
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,leading his army to\Nattack Doflamingo today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he's going to let us all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that he can save this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But he wants to sacrifice\Nhis life to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This brave soldier will\Nalways be at your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will settle this\Nbefore he has the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of him always\Nhaving to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, soldier, I'll\Nprotect you. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't make it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a toy soldier with only one leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.46,0:17:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A toy—may I offer to carry\Nyour belongings for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I met someone like\Nthat in front of the coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was probably him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.32,0:17:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not allowed to step\Nfoot outside the arena,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,even if we wanted to help your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.56,0:17:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, is it possible\Nfor a toy to be killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.92,0:18:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and being alive in the first\Nplace still seems weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not from around here, so\Nit's difficult to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't any different\Nfrom us humans—whether
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,it's being friends for\Nthe friendless siblings,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,for those without family, or\Nbringing love to the lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why it's against\Nthe law for them to live with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, ever since the day I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,day I When I lost my mother, I\Ndidn't have any family of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He brought me up like\NI was his own daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think of him as a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's more like a father to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you two sound really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.16,0:18:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patience, the\Nring has been fully repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, the match is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, are you eating food off the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When we were wrestling earlier, two\Nof the lunches fell on the floor, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You spent hard-earned money on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want them to go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, they still taste good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.36,0:19:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you don't look like a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The tournament's resuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Block D contestants to the rings!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, look at all the flowers I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I picked this one just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is from your mother to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We did good selling all the flowers today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be starving\Nfrom all your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, I was getting so hungry, my\Nstomach wouldn't stop growling. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really yummy. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's burning the bellens!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Make them stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the king doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our country's falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, lady scarlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the short? Shoot him! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm so hungry mother i'm starving i know\Ndear two days is a long time to wait
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to stay here alone for a while\Nokay rebecca you promise me you won't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,leave this spot no matter what i'm going\Nto bring us something to eat Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.28,0:21:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.12,0:21:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.88,0:21:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.14,0:21:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me to give you this food,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:22:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but you were waiting here\Npatiently for her to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring us something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.30,0:22:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.18,0:22:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The trail of blood leads over this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.46,0:22:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They gotta be around here somewhere close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.42,0:22:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.68,0:22:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you don't, I'll just\Neat it myself. Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.64,0:22:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to chew up all this food.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother was highborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a very special woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,These are dangerous times.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.60,0:23:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know we have a new king now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.54,0:23:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This new ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.08,0:23:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His mission is to capture anyone who\Nis related to the former nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And because you have your mother's\Nblood, he'll be coming for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.62,0:23:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret I couldn't\Nsave your mother's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will devote mine to\Nprotect yours, whatever the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, happiness will return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, I will stay by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.58,0:23:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather have my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you, because you couldn't save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.96,0:23:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.00,0:23:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:23:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you hate this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.92,0:24:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I spin around?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.32,0:24:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where are you going, Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.43,0:24:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.82,0:24:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The new king has people watching\Nthe village and your old house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.00,0:24:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.46,0:24:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rick dynasty has presided over this\Nland of misery and poverty for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,they even sank to stealing valuables from
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.18,0:24:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,their citizens in an\Nact of shameless greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.44,0:24:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.54,0:24:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make this\Ncountry wealthy instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.60,0:24:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess toys do know how to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.38,0:24:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to earn a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.94,0:24:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,YAAA!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.28,0:25:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,YAAA!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,YAAA! YAAA! YAAA!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.04,0:25:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No use!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.06,0:25:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm unbreakable!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I will never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.34,0:25:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.78,0:25:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This toy soldier is brave and true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.96,0:25:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In the rain or in the snow,\Nhe will stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.44,0:25:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cold for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.02,0:25:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This tin body feels nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.82,0:25:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,is that better yes your hand is very warm
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.10,0:26:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,this toy soldier is brave and true in the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.74,0:26:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,rain or in the snow he will stay with you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,how much he's lodging you can\Nstay in one of the empty houses
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.68,0:26:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,for free people lived here before\NPoor King Rick burned the town,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.58,0:26:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but most of them have moved away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so warm inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.68,0:26:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You should close the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.53,0:26:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's a\Nbunch of toys living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And other children too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.20,0:26:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go play.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.58,0:26:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But since there are other people in the\Nvillage, we'll have to follow the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.24,0:26:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,After you've gone to sleep, I'll\Ngo back to the house of toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll return before you wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.12,0:26:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To let you know I'm around,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drop a flower petal through the\Ncrack in the window every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.08,0:27:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, soldier, sir! Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.84,0:27:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a ralph!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.88,0:27:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You little monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.06,0:27:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Super cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.70,0:27:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this warrant a bonus?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.76,0:27:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A very happy birthday to you, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.68,0:27:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Read this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.14,0:27:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.05,0:27:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,my poor heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be an orphan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.12,0:27:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means no family's gonna miss her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.28,0:27:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.22,0:28:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we hit the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.36,0:28:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido like her will fetch us a good price.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.72,0:28:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're taking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.82,0:28:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.10,0:28:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bastard, you think a human\Nwill lose to some crappy toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.72,0:28:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna break you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.12,0:28:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Dad, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.74,0:28:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.50,0:28:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm on the wanted list now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.26,0:28:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.50,0:28:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find a new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.52,0:28:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I wish we could both actually\Nlive in the same house one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.16,0:28:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to learn to defend yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.36,0:29:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.27,0:29:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.86,0:29:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And what if something should happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.80,0:29:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.22,0:29:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother told me I should never\Nhurt others, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.44,0:29:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must protect yourself\Nfrom those who would hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.30,0:29:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.80,0:29:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always been at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.02,0:29:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Saved my life countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.38,0:29:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And here she comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.20,0:29:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The most beautiful gladiator in the\NColosseum, the infamous phantom princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.26,0:29:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,no other fighter could possibly\Nrile up the crowd more than her!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.96,0:29:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My soldier, please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.84,0:30:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You never gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.22,0:30:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.00,0:30:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.44,0:30:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.66,0:30:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.16,0:30:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.94,0:30:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get why everyone\Nhates her so much. Screw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.70,0:30:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a really nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.50,0:30:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, hey, she even bought me too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.58,0:30:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She's bound by her family's legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.92,0:30:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Her grandfather was our former king.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.98,0:30:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire country despises him.
